   "source": [
    "# Task 3: Event Impact Modeling\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "Model how events (policies, product launches, infrastructure investments) affect financial inclusion indicators over time.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Methodology Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook implements a comprehensive event impact modeling framework that:\n",
    "1. **Loads and processes impact data** from the enriched dataset\n",
    "2. **Joins events with impact links** to create complete event-indicator relationships\n",
    "3. **Builds formal impact models** with time decay, lag handling, and event interaction\n",
    "4. **Validates against historical data** using documented cases like Telebirr launch\n",
    "5. **Creates impact matrices** for visualization and analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
