    "## 1. Data Loading and Preparation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Load the enriched dataset\n",
    "df = pd.read_csv('../data/processed/ethiopia_fi_unified_data_enriched.csv')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Dataset shape: {df.shape}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Record types: {df['record_type'].value_counts()}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Extract different record types\n",
    "events_df = df[df['record_type'] == 'event'].copy()\n",
    "impact_links_df = df[df['record_type'] == 'impact_link'].copy()\n",
    "observations_df = df[df['record_type'] == 'observation'].copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\nEvents: {len(events_df)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Impact Links: {len(impact_links_df)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Observations: {len(observations_df)}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Event Impact Model Implementation\n",
    "\n",
    "### Model Specification\n",
    "\n",
    "We implement a **Multi-Event Impact Model** with the following components:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Base Impact Function**: $I_{e,i}(t) = M_{e,i} \\times D(t-t_e-L_{e,i}) \\times C_e$\n",
    "2. **Decay Functions** by event type\n",
    "3. **Combined Impact**: $I_i(t) = \\sum_e I_{e,i}(t)$ (additive assumption)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
